tion":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Ouch!","zh":"好痛！"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Short"}],"EIGHTIES_32_OUTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Yarbs! That was close... with so many exciting timing and rhythm changes!","zh":"好险！刚才真是千钧一发……那么多节奏与韵律的变化！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I fear we have only hit pause on Dr. Zomboss' heinous deal.","zh":"恐怕我们只是暂停了僵尸博士的邪恶阴谋。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed, next verse, same and yet worse! I go now to when you cannot imagine!","zh":"诚然，但是下一次相遇依旧更凶险！我将去往你无法想象的时空！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_33_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SHOUT","Lines":{"en":"The music is stronger. Let's rock!!","zh":"音乐愈发强劲了，摇滚起来吧！！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"The time rifts enabled zombies to form an even larger band.","zh":"时空裂隙使得僵尸组建起了更庞大的乐队。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"It might be a must to travel through other timelines and return when we obtain more plants.","zh":"我们可能有必要退回到其他时间线，等我们的队伍更加壮大时再回来。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_35_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Oh no! All the lawnmowers went to Dr. Zomboss' concert!","zh":"哦不！小推车都去听僵尸博士的演唱会了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Dr. Zomboss is just too charming.","zh":"僵尸博士实在是太有魅力了。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Never let zombies get close. We have no lawnmowers available.","zh":"千万别让僵尸靠近，我们没有小推车可用。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"By the way, I'm also going to the concert. See you.","zh":"另外，我也要去听演唱会了，回见。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"}],"EIGHTIES_26_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Say, Penny, do you think Intensive Carrots can be used to revive defeated plants?","zh":"潘妮，你复活萝卜能不能复活战败的植物？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"That's... that's exactly correct, User Dave.","zh":"那……那完全正确，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Sorry. It just confuses me when you pay attention.","zh":"抱歉。只是你这么认真，反而让我不知所措了。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_22_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Spore-shrooms have a unique ability, User Dave.","zh":"孢子菇有一项特殊能力，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"If they defeat a zombie, a new Spore-shroom will spawn where that zombie fell.","zh":"如果它们击败了一只僵尸，一株新的孢子菇就会在僵尸倒下的位置生成。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Hey-wah-zoo! Spore-shrooms mean more shrooms!","zh":"嘿哇咻！孢子菇意味着蘑菇大爆发！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"EIGHTIES_1_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Flashback! I remember this décor from when I chased squirbos as a kid!","zh":"真怀念啊！这布局让我想起小时候追松鼠了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed, User Dave. We appear to have arrived in the midst of a Neon Mixtape Tour.","zh":"确实如此，用户戴夫。我们似乎误入了炫光魔音游的派对中心。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I suspect the musical tempo may affect the zombies' speeds.","zh":"我怀疑音乐节拍能影响僵尸的速度。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I'm feeding the rhythm, I'M FEEDING THE RHYTHM!","zh":"我在滋养节奏，我在滋养节奏！！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"EIGHTIES_2_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Caution, User Dave.","zh":"小心，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"winnie/Say_Short"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I believe special zombies may display unique abilities while their preferred music is playing.","zh":"我认为特殊僵尸在播放其喜欢的音乐时，可能会展现特殊能力。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"You mean they'll jam their jam when their jam is jamming?","zh":"你是说他们会在即兴狂欢时再来段即兴狂欢？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Yes, correct, yes, and yes, User Dave.","zh":"正是如此，完全正确，千真万确，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_3_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I got a real Cactus feeling about this, Penny!","zh":"潘妮，我这次有种真切的仙人掌预感！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed, Cactus has changed over time, User Dave.","zh":"确实，经历这么长时间仙人掌也变了，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Now she fires a thorn for ranged damage, but hides for ground damage when zombies approach.","zh":"现在她能发射远程尖刺，但僵尸靠近时会缩地规避近战伤害。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"That's so Cactus... always varying her attack and defensive profiles!","zh":"不愧仙人掌啊……总是转换她的攻防模式！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_15_OUTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Somebody passed me a note in homeroom, Penny!","zh":"潘妮！有人在课前给我递了纸条！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"It says to meet behind the bike racks at lunchtime for a funderful surprise!","zh":"纸条上说午休时自行车架后见面，有一大笔惊喜等着我！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I believe some skepticism about this note is in order, User Dave.","zh":"用户戴夫，我认为对此纸条保持些许怀疑态度是必要的。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_16_INTRO":[{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Do you feel that you have grooved? Did you bang your head? Have you \"dug it\"?","zh":"你是否感到自己融入节奏？你有甩头吗？挖到精髓了没？"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Now the party is over! Melt before the musical might of my majestic Hair Metal Gargantuar!","zh":"派对到此结束！在我华丽重金属巨尸的音乐威压下融化吧！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I'm scared, Penny! It's two minutes to midnight!","zh":"我好害怕，潘妮！离午夜只剩两分钟了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Be brave, User Dave. We'll jilt this ditty... on rock and roll!","zh":"勇敢点，用户戴夫。我们要用摇滚的力量甩掉这首小调！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"EIGHTIES_17_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Mmm! Penny, do you smell something scrum-dicious?","zh":"嗯！潘妮，你有没有闻到什么诱人的香味？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"No, User Dave. Only Breakdancer Zombies.","zh":"没有，用户戴夫。只有霹雳舞僵尸在附近。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Maybe they're garlic-flavored!","zh":"没准它们喜欢大蒜！"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Short"}],"EIGHTIES_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Penny! Penny! Penny! A microphone!","zh":"潘妮！潘妮！潘妮！有麦克风！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Karaoke time! At last my tangerine dreams will come true!","zh":"卡拉OK时间到！我那柑橘味的梦想终于要实现了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Caution, User Dave. This dropped mic promises a banned battle of heavy petal proportions! ","zh":"警告，用户戴夫。这支掉落的麦克风将引发一场花瓣纷飞的禁忌之战！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}]},"ui":{}}
